OL,3,AUS investigating if missile hit Iran
OL,4,Awedding, Vance says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US military is investigating
OL,7,FIranian claims that its strikes killed
OL,8,Fat least four people including two
OL,9,Fchildren at a wedding in southern Iran,
OL,10,FVice-President JD Vance has said.
OL,12,FThe Iranian Red Crescent Society (IRCS)
OL,13,F- a humanitarian group - said shrapnel
OL,14,Ffrom a missile hit the ceremony at a
OL,15,Fhome in Sirik on Tuesday, prompting
OL,16,FIranian foreign ministry spokesman
OL,17,FEsmaeil Baqaei to declare it a "war
OL,18,Fcrime".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
