OL,3,AUS investigating if missile hit Iran
OL,4,Awedding, Vance says
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS missiles were fired the same day
OL,7,Fover "attempted attacks" by Iran on
OL,8,FAmerican forces, but a US Central
OL,9,FCommand spokesperson said it "never
OL,10,Ftargets civilians".
OL,12,FSpeaking on Thursday, Vance said he was
OL,13,F"extremely sceptical" over reports of
OL,14,Fthe alleged strike but confirmed the US
OL,15,Fwould investigate.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
